    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brady & McCarthy are delighted to present 11 Belarmine Close to the market, an impressive four-bedroom mid terrace family home ideally located within the highly regarded Belarmine development in Stepaside, Dublin 18.\r\n\r\nDeceptively spacious and wonderfully bright, this attractive home offers generously proportioned and versatile accommodation designed for comfortable modern living. With an abundance of natural light and a welcoming feel throughout, it presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of South Dublin’s most desirable residential locations.\r\n\r\nExtending over three floors, the property has been exceptionally well maintained and is presented in turnkey condition throughout. The accommodation is both bright and generously proportioned, with a practical layout ideally suited to modern family living.\r\n\r\nAt ground floor level, the accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a well-appointed living room and a spacious, light-filled open-plan kitchen and dining room, which truly forms the heart of the home. Designed with both family living and entertaining in mind, this impressive space is complemented by a separate family room, utility room and guest WC. The first floor comprises three bedrooms, including two double bedrooms, one of which benefits from an ensuite shower room, together with a single bedroom, family bathroom and hot press. The second floor is occupied by an impressive principal bedroom suite. This spacious and light filled room benefits from an ensuite bathroom, excellent eaves storage and additional fitted storage.\r\n\r\nTo the front of the property there is convenient parking. To the rear, the low maintenance garden features a generous patio area bordered by raised herbaceous planters, creating an attractive setting for outdoor dining and entertaining. A putting green provides an additional feature of particular interest to golfing enthusiasts, while a timber garden shed offers useful external storage.\r\n\r\nBelarmine enjoys a highly convenient location within easy walking distance of Stepaside Village, where a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and local services are available. Additional neighbourhood amenities are located within the Belarmine development itself, while Dundrum Town Centre, Sandyford Business District, Beacon South Quarter and Leopardstown Racecourse are all readily accessible.\r\n\r\nThe area is particularly well served by recreational and leisure amenities, including Fernhill Park & Gardens, West Wood Club, several golf clubs and equestrian centres, together with an extensive selection of walking and mountain-biking routes throughout the nearby Dublin Mountains.\r\n\r\n\r\nThere is also an excellent choice of schools and childcare facilities in the surrounding area, including Our Lady of the Wayside National School, Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille, Kilternan Church of Ireland NS, Stepaside Educate Together and Rosemont, amongst others.\r\nPublic transport links are well established, with the Luas Green Line and Dublin Bus routes 44, 47 and 118 providing convenient access to the city centre and surrounding areas. The M50 and N11 road networks are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nOffering generous and versatile accommodation, beautifully presented interiors and a wonderfully convenient setting, 11 Belarmine Close is a welcoming family home that combines comfort, space and ease of living. Ready to move into and enjoy, it is a property that is sure to appeal to those seeking a home of quality in this highly regarded location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nTiled floor, alarm and radiator cover. \r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\nTiled floor, wc, whb and wall mounted mirror. \r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nSolid Oak timber flooring, recessed lighting, feature fireplace, television point and double doors leading to: \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room/ Family Room \r\nLight filled open plan room with partially tiled floor and solid Oak timber flooring, fitted floor and wall units, granite countertop, tiled splash back, fridge freezer, Bosch oven and 4 plate hob, extractor fan, Whirlpool dishwasher, recessed lighting, radiator cover, television point, Velux x 1 and double access to rear garden. \r\n\r\nUtility Room \r\nTiled floor, Samsung washing machine and storage. Rear garden Patio, mature planting, putting green and timber shed.\r\n\r\n1st Floor Landing\r\nFitted carpet and shelved hot press.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nDouble bedroom with timber flooring and storage. \r\n\r\nEn-suite \r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, step in shower, wc, whb and wall mounted mirror. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\nDouble bedroom with timber flooring and storage. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 \r\nSingle bedroom with timber flooring and storage. \r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom \r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, bath with shower attachment, wc, whb, wall mounted mirror and heated towel rail. \r\n2nd Floor Landing\r\nFitted carpet, storage closet and Velux x 1 \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\nSpacious double bedroom with fitted carpet, storage, walk in wardrobe and access to attic space. \r\n\r\nEn-suite \r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, step in shower, wc, whb, wall mounted mirror and Velux x 1."
